{"availability":"available","full":"Danila1801/kaolin-demo-clinic","name":"kaolin-demo-clinic","description":"Demo clinic site with a constrained LLM intake assistant: server-side keys, per-IP rate limiting, streaming replies. Next.js 16.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-11T15:50:00Z","updated":"2026-09-18T12:23:34Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://kaolin-demo-clinic.vercel.app","topics":["chatbot","demo","groq","guardrails","llm","nextjs","rate-limiting","streaming","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://kaolin-demo-clinic.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T00:50:57.364Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T00:50:57.364Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T00:50:57.364Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:08:26.264Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T02:09:08.628Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T00:50:57.364Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A single-page clinic site with an embedded LLM intake assistant that helps a visitor describe their problem and routes them to the right treatment.","Everything on the page (clinic name, address, phone, hours, copy) is invented for the demo. Nothing here is a real business."],"features":["Intake assistant (components/chat/IntakeAssistant.tsx, app/api/chat/route.ts). A first point of contact that helps a visitor describe their problem, suggests which treatment fits, explains what a first visit involves,…","Key stays server-side. GROQAPIKEY is read only inside the route handler, pinned to the Node runtime, never shipped to the browser","Rate limited before any model call. Two Upstash sliding windows per IP, 5/min and 50/day, so one visitor cannot drain a shared free-tier quota. If the Upstash keys are absent the limiter falls open locally and the route…","Streams replies token by token to the client","Degrades cleanly. With no API key the site still runs and the assistant returns a clear 503 instead of crashing"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Danila1801/kaolin-demo-clinic/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d8eae9582458427c83d38705256d58cf0d2aa31a7b7cbc2518263549c9981514","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:26.374Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:26.374Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A single-page clinic site with an embedded LLM intake assistant that helps a visitor describe their problem and routes them to the right treatment.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Danila1801/kaolin-demo-clinic/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d8eae9582458427c83d38705256d58cf0d2aa31a7b7cbc2518263549c9981514","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Danila1801/kaolin-demo-clinic/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:26.375Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-18T12:23:34Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Danila1801/kaolin-demo-clinic/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:26.375Z","hash":"d8eae9582458427c83d38705256d58cf0d2aa31a7b7cbc2518263549c9981514","originalBytes":3232,"storedBytes":3232,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:08:26.264Z","subjects":["Chatbots & assistants"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":["Chatbots & assistants"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Chatbots & assistants","source":"metadata","match":"chatbot"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Mobile"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://kaolin-demo-clinic.vercel.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-15T17:21:10.417Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T17:21:10.417Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-15T17:21:10.417Z","target":"https://kaolin-demo-clinic.vercel.app/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-22T17:21:10.417Z